## Scorecard

Score each dimension from 0 to 5. Use `Not inspected` when no evidence exists.

| Dimension | Score | Evidence |
|---|---:|---|
| Workflow clarity | Not inspected | Record labels, empty states, next actions, and main user path evidence |
| Rerun/state correctness | Not inspected | Record session-state initialization, widget keys, callback order, and rerun behavior evidence |
| Side-effect safety | Not inspected | Record writes, confirmations, idempotency, authorization, and audit behavior evidence |
| Performance | Not inspected | Record cache boundaries, TTL, expensive work, pagination, and rendering behavior evidence |
| Security and secrets | Not inspected | Record secrets handling, auth, upload/download controls, logs, and private data evidence |
| Testability | Not inspected | Record unit tests, AppTest coverage, smoke checks, and manual validation evidence |
| Deployment readiness | Not inspected | Record dependencies, config, environment, startup, health checks, and logs evidence |
| Maintainability | Not inspected | Record file structure, separation of concerns, naming, and extension points evidence |

